Z||000002||BAM-BAM||05-27-2000||09:50 AM||||  Yes it does light up. If you go the the website and look undr "lighted rear "PONTIAC"<BR>lenses, you will see that it comes in two different packages. Package "A" lets you retain your backup lights nad package "B" you will lose your backup lights. Either way, It's a cool <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> mod. The website explains it all.<P> Late, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
